{
  "info": {
    "name": "ABDM HIE-CM Scan and Register",
    "description": "Generated from the ABDM HIE-CM specifications. Import hiecm-sandbox.postman_environment.json beside it and fill in clientId and clientSecret: the collection fetches a gateway session token before a call when it needs one.\n\nFolders follow the order a journey is built in. Callbacks are not included: ABDM sends those to your bridge URL, so receiving them needs a public endpoint, not Postman.\n\nValues ABDM expects encrypted, such as an Aadhaar number or an OTP, are shown as the specification gives them. Encrypt your own values before sending.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Gets a gateway session token when there is none or it has expired.",
          "if (pm.request.url.getPath().endsWith('/api/hiecm/gateway/v3/sessions')) return;",
          "const expiry = Number(pm.environment.get('accessTokenExpiry') || 0);",
          "if (pm.environment.get('accessToken') && Date.now() < expiry) return;",
          "pm.sendRequest({",
          "  url: pm.variables.replaceIn('{{gatewayUrl}}/api/hiecm/gateway/v3/sessions'),",
          "  method: 'POST',",
          "  header: {",
          "    'Content-Type': 'application/json',",
          "    'REQUEST-ID': pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'),",
          "    'TIMESTAMP': new Date().toISOString(),",
          "    'X-CM-ID': pm.variables.replaceIn('{{cmId}}'),",
          "  },",
          "  body: {",
          "    mode: 'raw',",
          "    raw: JSON.stringify({",
          "      clientId: pm.variables.get('clientId'),",
          "      clientSecret: pm.variables.get('clientSecret'),",
          "      grantType: 'client_credentials',",
          "    }),",
          "  },",
          "}, (error, response) => {",
          "  if (error || response.code >= 300) {",
          "    console.error('Session token request failed', error || response.text());",
          "    return;",
          "  }",
          "  const {accessToken, expiresIn} = response.json();",
          "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', accessToken);",
          "  // A minute early, so a token never expires between this check and the call.",
          "  pm.environment.set('accessTokenExpiry', Date.now() + (expiresIn - 60) * 1000);",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Scan and register",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2. Answer the patient share request",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "REQUEST-ID",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "TIMESTAMP",
                "value": "{{$isoTimestamp}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-CM-ID",
                "value": "{{cmId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/hiecm/patient-share/v3/on-share",
              "host": [
                "{{gatewayUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "hiecm",
                "patient-share",
                "v3",
                "on-share"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"acknowledgement\": {\n    \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n    \"abhaAddress\": \"<ABHA_ADDRESS>\",\n    \"profile\": {\n      \"context\": \"43\",\n      \"tokenNumber\": \"3\",\n      \"expiry\": 180\n    }\n  },\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"ABDM-9999\",\n    \"message\": \"Unknown exception\"\n  },\n  \"response\": {\n    \"requestId\": \"6f0b4665-a915-4c92-aa36-65afb4a2cd71\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Share the response of HIECM's /api/hiecm/patient-share/v3/on-share API.\n\n **Header**\n\nAUTHORIZATION will be provided by the gateway session API after the successful verification of client ID and Secret [ Example: ]\n\nREQUEST-ID unique UUID[ Example: 18235d89-cb13-479d-ad71-7a57d5f669a8 ]\n\nTIMESTAMP actual time of the requested was initiated[ Example: 2022-10-06T10:10:00.587Z ]\n\nX-CM-ID consent manager ID[ Example: sbx ]\n\n **Request Body**\n\nIncase of success scenario,acknowledgement is mandatory and error is optional\n\nIncase of failure scenario,error is mandatory and acknowledgment is optional\n\nresponse is mandatory object in both the cases"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
